  "description": "Eufuria is an 18+ furry convention experience in Upstate New York.\r\n\r\nOne of the largest furry conventions in the world, Anthrocon, originated right here in Albany. However, Upstate New York had been without a furry convention for many years. In 2023, we aimed to bring a furcon back to the long-underserved Capital Region. Our inaugural event was met with fervent response from the local furry community, inspiring us to move onwards and upwards and establish Eufuria as an annual convention.",
